### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health


### 2. About the API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/about


### 3. Get all support tickets - without token, should return 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets


### 3b. Get all support tickets - with USER token, should return 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbWlyLmhha2ltQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpc3MiOiJzdXBwb3J0LWRlc2stYXBpIiwibmFtZSI6IkFtaXIgSGFraW0iLCJleHAiOjE3ODYwMDU2MzgsImlhdCI6MTc4NjAwMjAzOCwidXNlcklkIjoiNmE3NDMwMzBiYTljMTk3NGQxODZlZDRkIn0.kW2f3eH8RSzmUIiGx5xmHgJAAA-64wSQqT55-qz6qMU


### 3c. Create ticket with USER token, should return 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbWlyLmhha2ltQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpc3MiOiJzdXBwb3J0LWRlc2stYXBpIiwibmFtZSI6IkFtaXIgSGFraW0iLCJleHAiOjE3ODYwMDU2MzgsImlhdCI6MTc4NjAwMjAzOCwidXNlcklkIjoiNmE3NDMwMzBiYTljMTk3NGQxODZlZDRkIn0.kW2f3eH8RSzmUIiGx5xmHgJAAA-64wSQqT55-qz6qMU
